  },
  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "A ROW OF YOUR OWN\n\nAny sequence you can make is a\nrow of the table. Train a\nrobot that answers a number on\nits nest with the next term to\na bird, put it in a room, and\ngive the All Sequences bird a\nbox holding [a nest its bird\nwrites to | a bird to that\nroom's nest].\n\nOpen a room here and copy how\n\"Numbers\" does it: it dozes on\n\"asked\", spends the number,\nsends its term, and adds 1."
