  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "GOING FURTHER\n\nWould Doubling instead of Add\n1 change that? (Careful: what\nif a term is 0?)\n\nNow suppose every row were\ndigits, 0 to 9, and the\nchanger sent 4 for a 5 and 5\nfor anything else. A sequence\nof digits is the decimal 0.d1\nd2 d3 ... -- a number between\n0 and 1. So there are more\nnumbers between 0 and 1 than\nthere are counting numbers,\nand Activity 6 counted every\nfraction."
